          "title": "You'll want to know: निद्रानाश",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निद्रानाश — nidrānāś — \"insomnia\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "काळजीमुळे त्याला निद्रानाश झाला. kāḷjīmuḷe tyālā nidrānāś jhālā. Worry gave him insomnia."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निद्रा, sleep, + नाश, ruin."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निद्रानाश (nidrānāś) is a learned compound built from two Sanskrit words, nidrā, \"sleep\" (CDIAL 7200), and nāśa, \"loss, destruction\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
