              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जांभई देणे — jāmbhaī deṇe — \"to yawn\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कंटाळवाण्या भाषणात सगळे जांभई देत होते. kaṇṭāḷvāṇyā bhāṣṇāt sagḷe jāmbhaī det hote. Everyone was yawning through the boring speech."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने जांभई दिली, tyāne jāmbhaī dilī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जांभई, a yawn; जांभई येणे, to feel a yawn coming, with the dative."
            }
          ]
        },
