              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जांभई देणे (jāmbhaī deṇe) is a Marathi phrase built on जांभई, \"a yawn\", which is inherited: CDIAL lists Old Marathi jāmbhaī, \"yawning\", under jṛmbhāyita (CDIAL 5266); देणे, \"to give\", is the light verb."
            }
